Exact replication of the .demo CSS card effect with a character portrait poster. 16s, 1920x1080, SILENT. Black background. One centered rotating card with the poster image. Dual counter-rotation: outer wrapper rotates one way, inner content the other, creating a gyroscope spin. Image floats forward with translateZ. Shiny sweep follows 4-waypoint path. Name label fades in below after card appears. Card spins the whole time
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,400&family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*, *:before, *:after {
box-sizing: border-box
margin: 0
padding: 0
}
html, body {
width: 1920px
height: 1080px
overflow: hidden
font-size: 10px; /* 1rem = 10px for easy rem usage */
}
body {
background: #000
display: flex
align-items: center
justify-content: center
position: relative
}
/* ── exact .demo replication ── */
demo {
position: relative
left: 0; top: 0
width: 32rem
height: 47rem
perspective: 1000px
transform-style: preserve-3d
animation: rotateReverse 3s infinite linear
}
demo__content {
position: relative
height: 100%
transform-style: preserve-3d
animation: rotate 3s infinite linear
transform: rotateX(10deg) rotateZ(0)
background: #fff
border-radius: 4px
}
demo__content:before {
content: ""
z-index: -1
position: absolute
left: 0; top: 0
width: 100%; height: 100%
box-shadow: 0 5rem 10rem rgba(0,0,0,0.55)
border-radius: 4px
}
demo__img {
overflow: hidden
position: absolute
left: -0.55rem
top: -0.35rem
width: calc(100% + 1.1rem)
height: calc(100% + 0.7rem)
transform: translateZ(5rem) scale(0.95)
border-radius: 3px
}
demo__img img {
position: absolute
left: 0; top: 0
width: 100%; height: 100%
object-fit: cover
object-position: center top
display: block
filter: grayscale(8%) contrast(1.06)
}
demo__img:after {
content: ""
z-index: 2
overflow: hidden
position: absolute
left: -20%; top: 0
width: 80%
padding-bottom: 80%
border-radius: 50%
background: radial-gradient(ellipse farthest-corner at center
rgba(255,255,255,0.22) 0%
rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%)
transform: translateY(-100%)
animation: shiny 3s infinite ease-in-out
}
/* exact 4-waypoint shiny path from original */
@keyframes shiny {
0%   { transform: translateY(-100%); }
25%  { transform: translateY(-100%); }
50%  { transform: translateY(500px); }
50.1%{ transform: translate(75%, 500px); }
75%  { transform: translate(75%, -100%); }
100% { transform: translateY(-100%); }
}
@keyframes rotate {
0%   { transform: rotateX(10deg) rotateZ(0deg); }
100% { transform: rotateX(10deg) rotateZ(360deg); }
}
@keyframes rotateReverse {
0%   { transform: rotateZ(0deg); }
100% { transform: rotateZ(-360deg); }
}
/* ── label ── */
#label {
position: absolute
bottom: 52px
left: 50%
transform: translateX(-50%)
text-align: center
opacity: 0
pointer-events: none
white-space: nowrap
}
#label .name {
font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif
font-size: 4.8rem
font-weight: 700
color: #f0ece4
line-height: .90
letter-spacing: -.01em
display: block
}
#label .sub {
font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif
font-size: 1.4rem
font-weight: 400
letter-spacing: .28em
text-transform: uppercase
color: rgba(240,236,228,0.38)
margin-top: 10px
display: block
}
/* open/close fades */
#open-fade, #close-fade {
position: absolute
inset: 0
z-index: 50
background: #000
pointer-events: none
}
#open-fade { opacity: 1; }
#close-fade { opacity: 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="open-fade"></div>
<div id="close-fade"></div>
<div class="demo" id="demo">
<div class="demo__content">
<div class="demo__img">
<img src="{{poster}}" alt="">
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="label">
<span class="name">Benedict Cumberbatch</span>
<span class="sub">London · 1976 – Present</span>
</div>
<script src="vendor/gsap.min.js"></script>
<script>
window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function(){
var tl = gsap.timeline()
/* open fade out */
tl.to('#open-fade', {opacity: 0, duration: 0.6, ease: 'power2.out'}, 0.0)
/* card scales in from small */
gsap.set('#demo', {scale: 0, opacity: 1})
tl.to('#demo', {scale: 1, duration: 0.8, ease: 'back.out(1.4)'}, 0.5)
/* label fades in */
tl.to('#label', {opacity: 1, duration: 0.6, ease: 'power2.out'}, 1.1)
/* hold — spin continues via CSS */
/* exit */
tl.to('#label', {opacity: 0, duration: 0.4, ease: 'power2.in'}, 14.8)
tl.to('#demo',  {scale: 0, opacity: 0, duration: 0.55, ease: 'power2.in'}, 14.9)
tl.to('#close-fade', {opacity: 1, duration: 0.7, ease: 'power2.inOut'}, 15.1)
tl.set('#close-fade', {opacity: 1}, 15.85)
})
</script>
</body>
</html>
```
